OmniMod Engine-Source Mirror License

Copyright (c) 2026 the OmniMod project.

This repository is a read-only reference mirror of a part of the OmniMod
game engine (the command-block and command-surface system, including the
DEV/PLAY dual-mode gates). It is published so that human map authors and
AI coding agents can read, learn from, and cite the exact code the engine
runs.

You MAY, free of charge:
  1. clone, read, search, and reference this code;
  2. quote excerpts (with file:line citations) in documentation, tutorials,
     map descriptions, and agent context packs;
  3. use the knowledge gained here to author original maps and data-driven
     command logic for OmniMod (your maps are your own work and are NOT
     covered by this license).

You MAY NOT:
  1. present this mirror (in whole or in substantial part) as your own
     engine, game, or command system;
  2. redistribute substantial verbatim portions of this tree under a
     different project name without written permission from the OmniMod
     maintainers;
  3. use this code to misrepresent compatibility ("works with OmniMod")
     for content you have not tested against the real game.

Contributions that fix documentation or manifest errors are welcome via
pull request; engine-code changes belong in the main OmniMod project, not
in this mirror (this tree is overwritten on every re-export).

THE CODE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR
IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE.
IN NO EVENT SHALL THE AUTHORS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM OR DAMAGES.
